{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** Invocation-end hooks previously ran in registration order, so reversing them globally changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations and can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies. Retain legacy ordering, or introduce an explicit scoped-cleanup mechanism whose participants opt into reverse unwinding.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77MbBR","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"3c642c0b4ac0e9022dd42f7e4cd11877ce00e852953d9c4142c531112319ad8a","observation_id":"aro_v1_hrscyc2kyduqelouf57ezuiyo7","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T03:40:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jyrf7mvlhnckcfrfbuwa7kwgjo","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"1735ff8302326dc678019e4d55498f001e003841","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_y5sx7bi6w7bbstfrw5t4ulspeb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T03:40:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
